\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. Dlr Flat At 94.1 Centavos On Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 199 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 1995\par 23:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar was flat Tuesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept the trading level at 94.1 centavos on \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  At Tuesday's close, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were quoting the dollar at a sell rate of 94.0 centavos and a buy rate of 94.1 centavos on the commercial market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted two auctions on the commercial market to hold the rate from slipping. \par \par \uc2  The present \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate was established Monday through \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The dollar rose 0.6 centavo Monday. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said that there was a slight surplus of dollars entering Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Tuesday but that volume was fairly slow. \par \par \uc2  Monday's mini devaluation was consistent with the government's new \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. On June 22 the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a new exchange rate band for the dollar of 91-99 centavos, from a previous range of 88-93 centavos. \par \par \uc2  At the end of 1994, the dollar was trading at around 85 centavos on Brazil's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-08-95 \par \par \uc2  2126GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8f06724\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
