\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. Dlr Same At 93.5 Centavos On Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 1995\par 22:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar was unchanged, trading for 93.5 centavos on Brazil's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday in a day marked by two \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At Friday's close, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were quoting the dollar at a sell rate of 93.6 centavos and a buy rate of 93.4 centavos on the commercial market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held two auctions to support the dollar's level Friday, as it has done on many occasions in recent weeks. The dollar was bought at 93.5 centavos in both auctions. \par \par \uc2  'More than $400 million came into \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  today (Friday), so the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the market at a substantial level,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. \par \par \uc2  A substantial portion of those dollars entered Brazil's stock markets, which had their highest volumes in months on Friday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers say the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased an estimated $4.5 billion to $6 billion in July, boosting its reserves considerably. \par \par \uc2  On June 22 the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a new exchange rate band for the dollar of 91-99 centavos, from a previous range of 88-93 centavos. The move is seen as allowing the real to continue its gradual devaluation against the dollar. At the end of 1994, the dollar was trading at around 85 centavos on Brazil's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-08-95 \par \par \uc2  2059GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8405xwr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
