\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\uc2  Twice In  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juni 1995\par 18:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's commerical \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Friday morning, traders said. \par \par \uc2  In the first auction, the Bank simultaneously bought dollars at 91.8 centavos and sold at 92.0 centavos.  In the second, it sold dollars at 92.3 centavos. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader said the Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  first to hold the dollar steady at its level of the last week. Then, as the dollar pushed up to 92.3 centavos, the Bank moved to prevent the rate from rising too quickly. \par \par \uc2  'After the first auction, the dollar started rising steadily,' the trader said. 'When it got to 92.3, the Bank stepped in.' \par \par \uc2  The trader said the market came to a virutal standstill after the second auction, with banks offering to buy dollars at 92.15 centavos and to sell at 92.25 centavos. \par \par \uc2  The dollar rose Friday morning as a number of banks, principally foreign ones, bought dollars to zero their positions for the end of the month, the trader said. \par \par \uc2  'There's also a general belief on the market that the dollar should move a little higher,' he said. \par \par \uc2  On June 22 the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made room for the dollar to continue its gradual appreciation against the real by altering its dollar/real exchange rate band to 91-99 centavos from the previous band of 88-93 centavos. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-06-95 \par \par \uc2  1655GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr6u04u8l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
