 would be moved to 86-93 centavos as of May. That set off a flurry of speculation on a rising dollar and early repayment of dollar-denominated debt. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-03-95 \par \par \uc2  0112GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3e01uv7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
