\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Cen Bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  heavily to defend real. \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO, March 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real closed off 0.1 percent against the dollar in volatile trading in a session in which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  more than 30 times and spent at least $2 billion to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  In the commercial exchange rate market, the real closed off 0.1 percent, at 0.888 to the greenback, while in the floating rate market the real ended up 0.2 percent at 0.896. \par \par \uc2  Traders said it was impossible to say exactly how much the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had spent to bolster the real, but market estimates varied between $2 and $6 billion. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold heavily in the market because there was a strong demand since the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy is not yet clear enough," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  desk manager at an investment bank. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not disclose the amount sold during auctions. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold $3 billion in the first two days of trading after the definition on Monday of a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate band. \par \par \uc2  The confusion in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market unnerved stock investors, and Sao Paulo's Bovespa index of leading shares dropped 9.5 percent. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy on Thursday was a sign that officials were willing to spend heavily to hold the real at their desired level. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also announced on Thursday an auction of dollar-indexed treasury notes to be held on Friday. The face value of the notes in the sale is 2.08 billion reals, the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  -- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-232-4411 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr3a00h9j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
