\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 /22nd Time -2: Dlr Unchanged At 88.5 C \b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 21:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets 22 times Thursday, selling a large quantity of dollars, traders said. \par \par \uc2  In the 22nd \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank sold dollars at the commercial rate of 88.5 centavos about 1955 GMT, traders said. It was the 11th \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the commercial market Thursday. At 2000 gmt, the dollar was trading at 88.5 centavos on the commercial market, the same as during earlier \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In the 21st \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank sold dollars at the floating rate of 89.5 centavos about 1955 GMT, traders said. It was the 11th \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the floating market Thursday. At 2000 gmt, the dollar was trading at 89.5 centavos on the floating market, the same as during the earlier \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said the volume appeared to be extremely heavy and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trying to keep the market firm. \par \par \uc2  Traders said they were losing track of the number of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which they believe is a record. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlig