out amounts. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-03-95 \par \par \uc2  1902GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3901r2v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
