\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Up 0.4 Centavos To 88.6 In  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 22:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar gained 0.4 centavo Wednesday, closing at 88.6 centavos on \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push the dollar down. \par \par \uc2  At Wednesday's close, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were selling the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 88.7 centavos and buying at 88.5 centavos at the commercial rate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  four times in the floating market. At the end of the day, dealers were selling the floating dollar at 89.6 centavos and buying at 89.3 centavos. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's floating market is used mainly for transactions by tourists and for remittances to and from Brazilians living abroad. It operates as the legal end of the illegal but widely tolerated black market. \par \par \uc2  The commercial market is used for transactions involving foreign investment, imports and exports. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday that the dollar will trade in the 86-90 centavo range, up from a previous informal range of about 82-86 centavos. \par \par \uc2  Dealers described Wednesday's market as 'extremely nervous' with traders speculating on the new limits. \par \par \uc2  Trading volumes were described as heavy. Dealers said there was big demand from banks which are adjusting their \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions; they say banks are buying on their own behalf rather than for clients. \par \par \uc2  On May 2 the band will widen to between 86 and 98 centavos. \par \par \uc2  The government had previously set an unofficial range of 82-86 centavos and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when trading moved outside those limits. \par \par \uc2  The commercial rate moved quicker than the black market, where the dollar was changing hands at 88 centavos. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-03-95 \par \par \uc2  2121GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3801prt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
