\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr Up 1.9 Centavos To 89.9 In  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 22:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SAO PAULO (AP-DJ)--The U.S. dollar gained 1.9 centavos Tuesday, closing at 89.9 centavos on \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's commercial \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times to contain dollar gains. \par \par \uc2  At Tuesday's close, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were selling the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 90.0 centavos and buying at 89.8 centavos. Before the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the buy rate had reached 90.2 centavos. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Monday that the dollar will trade in the 86-90 centavo range, up from a previous informal range of about 82-86 centavos. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the policy change amounts to an effective devaluation, though the government refuses to characterize it as such. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer described Tuesday's market as 'nervous' with traders testing out the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new limits. \par \par \uc2  'Nobody knew if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would come in or not,' he emphasized. \par \par \uc2  Brokers said Tuesday's trading volumes were average. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when large volumes push values up or down rapidly. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said he expects to see the dollar stay at or near the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  limit of 90 for the meantime, with speculators coming in to test the limit. \par \par \uc2  On May 2 the band will widen to between 86 and 98 centavos. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to have to spend a lot of dollars on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' he noted. \par \par \uc2  The government had previously set an unofficial range of 82-86 centavos and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when trading moved outside those limits. But it would never acknowledge the range except to say it was using a 'band system.' \par \par \uc2  The commercial rate moved quicker than the black market, where the dollar was changing hands at 86 centavos. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-03-95 \par \par \uc2  2159GMT \par \par \uc2  1156 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3701ndl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
