\par\par \b \uc2  Brazil's Malan Says He Has No Plans For Real Indexation \b0\par\par\uc2 131 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Januar 1995\par 20:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BRASILIA (AP-DJ)--Finance Minister Pedro Malan, under pressure to allow Brazil's real to depreciate in line with inflation, said Thursday that he has no plans to change the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  Asked by legislators in the Senate Economic Affairs Committee why he is refusing to peg the real to inflation, Malan said 'that would signify failure of the real plan ... a return to the past.' \par \par \uc2  In spite of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the real in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Malan insists that the government is not managing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He emphasized again Thursday that 'the government won't administer \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-01-95 \par \par \uc2  1945GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1j007mj\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (brazil near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of fi